To get the closest options, I recommend prioritizing hotels within the Eixample district (postcode 08013), which surrounds the Sagrada Familia. Here are some top nearby hotel suggestions based on general availability and popularity for that period (prices are approximate in USD, starting from, and can vary; book soon as December is peak season). These are derived from common recommendations for the area—consider using a booking site like Booking.com or Hotels.com for real-time rates and to filter by "distance to Sagrada Familia":

