### Taxi Arrangement from Barcelona Sants to Sagrada Familia

I've arranged a taxi search for December 20, 2024, at 5:00 PM (17:00 in 24-hour format) from Barcelona Sants Railway Station (address: Pl. dels Països Catalans, 1-7, Sants-Montjuïc, 08014 Barcelona, Spain) to Sagrada Familia (Eixample, 08013 Barcelona, Spain). The drive is about 6 km (3.7 miles) and takes approximately 23 minutes, depending on traffic.

Here are the available taxi options (all non-refundable but cancellable up to 24 hours in advance; prices in USD, for up to the listed passenger capacity including luggage). These are from reliable suppliers like Welcome PickUps and Golden Wheels:

